[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l010","ordinal":284673,"en":"The stars streamed from the heavens,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l011","ordinal":284674,"en":"And every living creature"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l012","ordinal":284675,"en":"Rose from its place, calling out."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l013","ordinal":284676,"en":"The willow branches bent,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l014","ordinal":284677,"en":"Lines were traced across the sand,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l015","ordinal":284678,"en":"The reed tops trembled,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l016","ordinal":284679,"en":"And young larks chirped over the steppe."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l017","ordinal":284680,"en":"The yellow dawn broke,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l018","ordinal":284681,"en":"And Libra sank from the sky."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l019","ordinal":284682,"en":"Mist thinned from mountain after mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l020","ordinal":284683,"en":"And countless springs poured through the ravines."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l021","ordinal":284684,"en":"Ninety kinds of birds sang plaintively,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l022","ordinal":284685,"en":"And the nightingale’s voice was heard;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l023","ordinal":284686,"en":"The cuckoo called melodiously,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l024","ordinal":284687,"en":"And all kinds of woodland birds"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l025","ordinal":284688,"en":"Began to speak."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l026","ordinal":284689,"en":"Wild goats cried from the heights,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l027","ordinal":284690,"en":"And stags called from the knolls."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l028","ordinal":284691,"en":"The fog lifted everywhere,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l029","ordinal":284692,"en":"Light spread over the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l030","ordinal":284693,"en":"And when the land came into view,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l031","ordinal":284694,"en":"The horse beneath him"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l032","ordinal":284695,"en":"Was Köbösh Khan’s Kökborchuk."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l033","ordinal":284696,"en":"Upon that racer Kökborchuk,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l034","ordinal":284697,"en":"Striking right and left with his whip,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l035","ordinal":284698,"en":"Your hero Kanchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l036","ordinal":284699,"en":"Rode on in feverish haste,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l037","ordinal":284700,"en":"The consummate, accursed villain,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l038","ordinal":284701,"en":"Madly searching for Külchoro."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b003:l039","ordinal":284702,"en":"When he looked toward Kara-Üngkür,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l001","ordinal":284703,"en":"Eager to find Külchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l002","ordinal":284704,"en":"He saw the cave mouth had been covered"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l003","ordinal":284705,"en":"And that across its entrance"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l004","ordinal":284706,"en":"Rotten grass had been scattered."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l005","ordinal":284707,"en":"The hero Külchoro was hidden there,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l006","ordinal":284708,"en":"But the heel mark of his horseshoe-soled boot"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l007","ordinal":284709,"en":"Stood out plainly in the open."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l008","ordinal":284710,"en":"Kanchoro halted and shouted,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l009","ordinal":284711,"en":"Calling to hero Kyyaz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l010","ordinal":284712,"en":"Of the Jediger:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l011","ordinal":284713,"en":"“Fortunate hero Kyyaz,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l012","ordinal":284714,"en":"Your campaign has prospered!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l013","ordinal":284715,"en":"What you lost has come onto your road;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l014","ordinal":284716,"en":"Though delayed, your luck has turned—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l015","ordinal":284717,"en":"Your fugitive has come onto your road."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l016","ordinal":284718,"en":"Hero Kyyaz of the Jediger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l017","ordinal":284719,"en":"Your old good fortune has returned."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l018","ordinal":284720,"en":"Let your wrestlers and lions,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l019","ordinal":284721,"en":"Your heroes who boast of their strength,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l020","ordinal":284722,"en":"Your able men skilled with the spear,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l021","ordinal":284723,"en":"And all your strongest men come without mercy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l022","ordinal":284724,"en":"To seize Külchoro!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l023","ordinal":284725,"en":"Come, you wolves never sated with blood;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l024","ordinal":284726,"en":"Let your most capable men"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l025","ordinal":284727,"en":"Charge the warrior head-on"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l026","ordinal":284728,"en":"And capture him alive."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l027","ordinal":284729,"en":"Plunge Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l028","ordinal":284730,"en":"Into misery so deep he cannot escape;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l029","ordinal":284731,"en":"Subject the wretch"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l030","ordinal":284732,"en":"To merciless torment."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l031","ordinal":284733,"en":"Bind both his hands"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l032","ordinal":284734,"en":"And hamstring him."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l033","ordinal":284735,"en":"Do not kill him or let him vanish;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l034","ordinal":284736,"en":"Take vengeance as heavy as a mattock."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l035","ordinal":284737,"en":"Hollow out his right shoulder,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l036","ordinal":284738,"en":"And flay his left shoulder!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l037","ordinal":284739,"en":"Make him the lowly slave"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l038","ordinal":284740,"en":"Of some sixty herdsmen,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1286:b004:l039","ordinal":284741,"en":"Fetching their firewood and water."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l001","ordinal":284742,"en":"Morning and evening, twice a day,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l002","ordinal":284743,"en":"Stretch him out and beat him like a hide."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l003","ordinal":284744,"en":"Deliver punishment with your own hands"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l004","ordinal":284745,"en":"Upon this slave who calls himself a hero!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l005","ordinal":284746,"en":"Do not kill him quickly;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l006","ordinal":284747,"en":"Kill him through humiliation"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l007","ordinal":284748,"en":"And give him his punishment!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l008","ordinal":284749,"en":"Your valiant Khan Kyyaz,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l009","ordinal":284750,"en":"Surge in and enter;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l010","ordinal":284751,"en":"Take the monstrous warrior"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l011","ordinal":284752,"en":"As your spoil!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l012","ordinal":284753,"en":"Against the warrior in the cave,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l013","ordinal":284754,"en":"The lion favored by fate,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l014","ordinal":284755,"en":"The hero lying helpless"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l015","ordinal":284756,"en":"With ninety wounds,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l016","ordinal":284757,"en":"The Jediger closed in from every side,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l017","ordinal":284758,"en":"Loosing their bows like rain"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l018","ordinal":284759,"en":"And shooting arrows like hail."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l019","ordinal":284760,"en":"From every direction"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l020","ordinal":284761,"en":"Came shouting men with leveled spears."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l021","ordinal":284762,"en":"All those shouting"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l022","ordinal":284763,"en":"Raised the battle cry “Kyyaz!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l023","ordinal":284764,"en":"Their bows rained shafts,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l024","ordinal":284765,"en":"Their arrows fell like hail,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l025","ordinal":284766,"en":"And the Jediger swept inside."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l026","ordinal":284767,"en":"Then Külchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l027","ordinal":284768,"en":"His strength spent and power gone,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l028","ordinal":284769,"en":"His whole body drained of blood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l029","ordinal":284770,"en":"Was burning inside and out,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l030","ordinal":284771,"en":"His entrails aflame with fire."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l031","ordinal":284772,"en":"He had the soul of a champion in battle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l032","ordinal":284773,"en":"But the wretched warrior was helpless."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l033","ordinal":284774,"en":"His eyes alone stared pleadingly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l034","ordinal":284775,"en":"His joints had failed and hung limp;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l035","ordinal":284776,"en":"His vigor was spent, his strength gone,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l036","ordinal":284777,"en":"His face pale from loss of blood."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l037","ordinal":284778,"en":"All power had left Külchoro."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l038","ordinal":284779,"en":"As the champions surged upon him"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b003:l039","ordinal":284780,"en":"And encircled him,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l001","ordinal":284781,"en":"About to plunge him into bitter misery,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l002","ordinal":284782,"en":"He grasped Joykuma, his khan-father’s sword,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l003","ordinal":284783,"en":"By the hilt,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l004","ordinal":284784,"en":"Drew it from its sheath,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l005","ordinal":284785,"en":"Swung it in his grip,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l006","ordinal":284786,"en":"And hewed fifty champions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l007","ordinal":284787,"en":"Clean apart."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l008","ordinal":284788,"en":"Those farther away"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l009","ordinal":284789,"en":"He made crawl beneath his spear,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l010","ordinal":284790,"en":"And those who came nearer"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l011","ordinal":284791,"en":"He toyed with upon his sword."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l012","ordinal":284792,"en":"The famed lionhearted hero"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l013","ordinal":284793,"en":"Whirled about in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l014","ordinal":284794,"en":"Hurling every champion he seized"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l015","ordinal":284795,"en":"Like a blue-gray kid."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l016","ordinal":284796,"en":"He crushed all who faced him—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l017","ordinal":284797,"en":"Where now were their brave men?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l018","ordinal":284798,"en":"He smashed all who approached—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l019","ordinal":284799,"en":"Where now were their tigers?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l020","ordinal":284800,"en":"Warrior Külchoro kept them at bay,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l021","ordinal":284801,"en":"Refusing to submit"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l022","ordinal":284802,"en":"To the Jediger’s violence."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l023","ordinal":284803,"en":"Külchoro would not surrender"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l024","ordinal":284804,"en":"His fly-like soul to that host."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l025","ordinal":284805,"en":"Hero Kyyaz of the Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l026","ordinal":284806,"en":"Came thrusting with his spear,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l027","ordinal":284807,"en":"Intent on binding Külchoro;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l028","ordinal":284808,"en":"Firing his gun and loosing his bow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l029","ordinal":284809,"en":"He drove resolutely in."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l030","ordinal":284810,"en":"Wearing a coat like a mountain’s ash,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l031","ordinal":284811,"en":"Riding his swift bay stallion,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l032","ordinal":284812,"en":"He tied up short the streaming tail"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l033","ordinal":284813,"en":"Of his restless sorrel horse."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l034","ordinal":284814,"en":"Burning with eagerness, hero Kyyaz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l035","ordinal":284815,"en":"Charged against the warrior."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l036","ordinal":284816,"en":"When you looked upon Külchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l037","ordinal":284817,"en":"The breath from his mouth"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l038","ordinal":284818,"en":"Was like the wind through a mountain valley,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1287:b004:l039","ordinal":284819,"en":"As though it would devour whoever faced him."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l001","ordinal":284820,"en":"His strength was beyond compare."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l002","ordinal":284821,"en":"When you looked upon the fierce warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l003","ordinal":284822,"en":"His courage was just as extraordinary:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l004","ordinal":284823,"en":"Thick-armed and stone-hearted,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l005","ordinal":284824,"en":"A fierce man resembling a lion,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l006","ordinal":284825,"en":"He leveled his spear wherever battle raged."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l007","ordinal":284826,"en":"The champions who clashed with him"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l008","ordinal":284827,"en":"Craved a patch of ground as small as a hare’s."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l009","ordinal":284828,"en":"He did not flinch when a gun was fired,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l010","ordinal":284829,"en":"And when they closed in combat,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l011","ordinal":284830,"en":"He did not fearfully leave his flank exposed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l012","ordinal":284831,"en":"His tigerish eyes blazed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l013","ordinal":284832,"en":"And he bit his lips until they split."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l014","ordinal":284833,"en":"When he turned and looked you in the face,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l015","ordinal":284834,"en":"He seemed the very mold of seasoned warriors."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l016","ordinal":284835,"en":"The wind issuing from his mouth"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l017","ordinal":284836,"en":"Was like a tempest from Bukhara;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l018","ordinal":284837,"en":"The fury of his two eyes"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l019","ordinal":284838,"en":"Was like embers in a riverbed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l020","ordinal":284839,"en":"And when he muttered, his voice"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l021","ordinal":284840,"en":"Was like the shot of a cannon."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l022","ordinal":284841,"en":"When one looked before him,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l023","ordinal":284842,"en":"A black-maned tiger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l024","ordinal":284843,"en":"Seemed poised to tear open a wound;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l025","ordinal":284844,"en":"A black-striped tiger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l026","ordinal":284845,"en":"Crouched directly in front"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l027","ordinal":284846,"en":"Of this ill-fated man,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l028","ordinal":284847,"en":"While a devouring dragon,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l029","ordinal":284848,"en":"Its jaws gaping cavernously,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l030","ordinal":284849,"en":"Crouched behind him."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l031","ordinal":284850,"en":"The giant Zümrük bird"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l032","ordinal":284851,"en":"Seemed ready to swoop down at once,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l033","ordinal":284852,"en":"Its talons stretched wide."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l034","ordinal":284853,"en":"He wheeled like a tiger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l035","ordinal":284854,"en":"And none who grappled with him survived."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l036","ordinal":284855,"en":"His wrathful aspect was unlike any other,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l037","ordinal":284856,"en":"Overawing the whole wide world."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l038","ordinal":284857,"en":"The renowned master of battle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b003:l039","ordinal":284858,"en":"His quiver curved like the waist of a maiden,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l001","ordinal":284859,"en":"Was a raging black calamity"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l002","ordinal":284860,"en":"That seemed ready to devour any foe."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l003","ordinal":284861,"en":"His appearance was strange, his venom strong;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l004","ordinal":284862,"en":"If you met him, you abandoned hope of life."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l005","ordinal":284863,"en":"Such was his form:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l006","ordinal":284864,"en":"Broad-chested, with expansive shoulders,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l007","ordinal":284865,"en":"Wide-mouthed and beetle-browed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l008","ordinal":284866,"en":"Broad-browed and deep-eyed—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l009","ordinal":284867,"en":"Thus had the Creator made the warrior."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l010","ordinal":284868,"en":"Taking a mace as large as a house,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l011","ordinal":284869,"en":"He scowled and raised havoc."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l012","ordinal":284870,"en":"He struck a black rock once,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l013","ordinal":284871,"en":"Sparks bursting from his mace"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l014","ordinal":284872,"en":"And fire leaping from the stone."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l015","ordinal":284873,"en":"In the close-fought struggle"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l016","ordinal":284874,"en":"He never fearfully exposed his flank,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l017","ordinal":284875,"en":"And of the champions who faced him"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l018","ordinal":284876,"en":"He crushed many into the earth."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l019","ordinal":284877,"en":"When Kyyaz saw Külchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l020","ordinal":284878,"en":"He could not endure his heat"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l021","ordinal":284879,"en":"Or withstand his cold;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l022","ordinal":284880,"en":"He could not advance to confront him"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l023","ordinal":284881,"en":"Or plant his spear firmly."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l024","ordinal":284882,"en":"Turning his back, hero Kyyaz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l025","ordinal":284883,"en":"Could not bear it and withdrew."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l026","ordinal":284884,"en":"He wheeled his horse and fled;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l027","ordinal":284885,"en":"When he saw the warrior’s might,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l028","ordinal":284886,"en":"He could not turn back and wreak havoc,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l029","ordinal":284887,"en":"But pleaded with Kanchoro:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l030","ordinal":284888,"en":"“My dear comrade,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l031","ordinal":284889,"en":"Your lifelong companion Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l032","ordinal":284890,"en":"Is blessed with perfect fortune."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l033","ordinal":284891,"en":"Look into the heart of this matter—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l034","ordinal":284892,"en":"Good heavens, comrade, consider it!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l035","ordinal":284893,"en":"He is a son destined to be a fortress"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l036","ordinal":284894,"en":"For the eagle of the yellow bluff,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l037","ordinal":284895,"en":"A son destined to be a shield"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l038","ordinal":284896,"en":"Not merely for the Kyrgyz, but for all the ages."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1288:b004:l039","ordinal":284897,"en":"He is a peerless, valiant hero."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l001","ordinal":284898,"en":"His very form sets him apart from all others,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l002","ordinal":284899,"en":"He is both a hero and a man of bitter fate,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l003","ordinal":284900,"en":"A true man would not dare lay hands on him;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l004","ordinal":284901,"en":"He is a genuinely born hero."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l005","ordinal":284902,"en":"I marveled when I saw his stature—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l006","ordinal":284903,"en":"No other soul like him will be born."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l007","ordinal":284904,"en":"No one facing him has ever struck,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l008","ordinal":284905,"en":"No man has ever dared grapple with the hero."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l009","ordinal":284906,"en":"This truly born Külchoro—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l010","ordinal":284907,"en":"Can anyone who tangles with him prosper?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l011","ordinal":284908,"en":"Against this sacred warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l012","ordinal":284909,"en":"Look—can one who attacks him survive?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l013","ordinal":284910,"en":"For these blessed Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l014","ordinal":284911,"en":"He was born to be their guardian;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l015","ordinal":284912,"en":"For these perfectly formed Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l016","ordinal":284913,"en":"He was born to be their khan;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l017","ordinal":284914,"en":"When enraged against the enemy,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l018","ordinal":284915,"en":"He is a son whose torrent overwhelms them."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l019","ordinal":284916,"en":"For this small, ancient Kyrgyz nation"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l020","ordinal":284917,"en":"He was born to be its backbone."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l021","ordinal":284918,"en":"This dark-fated hero—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l022","ordinal":284919,"en":"Seen from the front, he brings good fortune;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l023","ordinal":284920,"en":"Seen from behind, he seems an army countless strong."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l024","ordinal":284921,"en":"His radiant beauty is an omen of fortune,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l025","ordinal":284922,"en":"His wolf-like valor equals countless troops;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l026","ordinal":284923,"en":"His muscles are thick as a man’s waist,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l027","ordinal":284924,"en":"And when he surges, he seems ready to devour a soul."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l028","ordinal":284925,"en":"His strength is like tempered iron,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l029","ordinal":284926,"en":"And when he charges, he seems ready to devour a soul;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l030","ordinal":284927,"en":"His majesty is like a towering cliff,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1289:b003:l031","ordinal":284928,"en":"And when he grapples, he seems ready to devour a soul."}]
